{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>壺口瀑布位於黃河流經中國北部山西省臨汾市的河段，季節性地展現出獨特之美，一道彩虹出現在其異常清澈的水面上。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8507508_壺口瀑布現彩虹 黃河水清景致獨特 - 截图7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/fd7e095cd29643239efa57fbeca72825/snapshots/5e03482cbc1a4106be8fb435581f99e0-00007.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>壺口瀑布是中國第二長河黃河上最大的瀑布。壺口瀑布景區工作人員表示，冬季水量和泥沙含量減少，使這座氣勢磅礴的瀑布的水由黃濁變為清澈。同時，冬季頻繁的晴朗天氣也大大增加出現彩虹的可能性。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8507508_壺口瀑布現彩虹 黃河水清景致獨特 - 截图5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/fd7e095cd29643239efa57fbeca72825/snapshots/5e03482cbc1a4106be8fb435581f99e0-00005.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在陽光沐浴下，絢麗的彩虹橫跨清澈傾瀉的水面，構成如畫的景象，吸引遊客前來欣賞這壯麗的冬季美景。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:03:52.292650+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:57:12.419582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:57:15.334105+00:00","content_hash":"1c4e07d5a17d220f0824acd1931a50ab832a3c4383153b255c7e63c69ca5f042","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:03:52.292650+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}